{
  "source": "course-assets/how-ai-answers/how-ai-answers.mp4",
  "duration": 182.784,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.32,
      "text": "When you ask an AI a question, it first works out what your words mean together."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.04,
      "end": 8.42,
      "text": "But once it understands your prompt, how does it actually begin its reply?"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.14,
      "end": 10.44,
      "text": "Let's look at a simple example."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.32,
      "end": 12.56,
      "text": "What should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.34,
      "end": 15.22,
      "text": "This board shows how the process starts."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.04,
      "end": 20.12,
      "text": "First, the AI breaks your question down into smaller pieces, called tokens."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.98,
      "end": 25.46,
      "text": "Then it assigns positions, which marks exactly where each piece belongs in the sentence."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.26,
      "end": 28.4,
      "text": "Next, it turns these tokens into numbers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.4,
      "end": 31.08,
      "text": "starting vectors that carry their initial meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.8,
      "end": 34.04,
      "text": "As this information passes through the model's layers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.52,
      "end": 38.62,
      "text": "attention mechanisms update those numbers, using context from the entire message."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.48,
      "end": 42.22,
      "text": "The entire reading process builds toward the end of the prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.92,
      "end": 47.3,
      "text": "The AI relies on this final token's updated numbers to predict what word comes next."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.76,
      "end": 51.44,
      "text": "This board isolates that exact transition point."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.06,
      "end": 53.48,
      "text": "The moment reading becomes writing."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.26,
      "end": 58.14,
      "text": "We are looking at how the AI prepares to generate the very first word of its response."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.84,
      "end": 61.14,
      "text": "The final token acts as a funnel."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.9,
      "end": 65.92,
      "text": "The question mark gathers information from every single token before it."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.52,
      "end": 69.96,
      "text": "The AI takes this specific final token's updated vector"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.32,
      "end": 74.32,
      "text": "and uses it to calculate a probability score for every possible word."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.1,
      "end": 77.3,
      "text": "That single token is the launching pad,"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.58,
      "end": 82.34,
      "text": "providing the exact mathematical information needed to predict a fitting first token."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.72,
      "end": 86.72,
      "text": "This comparison shows the prediction loop in action,"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.72,
      "end": 90.98,
      "text": "evaluating options for the first word based on that final question mark."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.7,
      "end": 94.6,
      "text": "At prediction one, a dog name isn't highly probable yet."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.06,
      "end": 100.26,
      "text": "Instead, generic sentence starters like you score mathematically as the most likely next steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.96,
      "end": 102.2,
      "text": "The AI selects you."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.86,
      "end": 107.22,
      "text": "Then it loops this same prediction process three more times to add the words could,"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.72,
      "end": 108.52,
      "text": "name, and him."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.16,
      "end": 110.54,
      "text": "Take a look at the context now."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.98,
      "end": 113.6,
      "text": "With the generated sentence reading, you could name him."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.6,
      "end": 117.28,
      "text": "How does this growing context change what the AI predicts next?"
    },
    {
      "start": 118.08,
      "end": 122.02,
      "text": "By prediction five, the added tokens change what fits logically in the sequence."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.72,
      "end": 128.32,
      "text": "Because of the new context, a specific dog name like Spot jumps to the top of the probability list."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.9,
      "end": 131.46,
      "text": "The AI continuously repeats this dynamic loop,"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.8,
      "end": 137.02,
      "text": "predicting and adding words until it generates a special token that signals the complete answer is finished."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.82,
      "end": 140.32,
      "text": "The AI does not write entire paragraphs at once."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.86,
      "end": 143.26,
      "text": "Every single added token changes the context,"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.84,
      "end": 147.36,
      "text": "ensuring the output naturally narrows down to a specific answer like Spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.02,
      "end": 153.76,
      "text": "This diagram illustrates a formal summary of the continuous repeating generation loop we just"
    },
    {
      "start": 153.76,
      "end": 155.04,
      "text": "witnessed with the dog name example."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.74,
      "end": 160.34,
      "text": "In the first half of the process, the AI ranks all possible next tokens by how well they fit,"
    },
    {
      "start": 160.74,
      "end": 161.6,
      "text": "and then picks the winner."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.26,
      "end": 164.86,
      "text": "Next, it adds the selected token to the growing answer,"
    },
    {
      "start": 165.24,
      "end": 167.7,
      "text": "and repeats the cycle using the newly extended context."
    },
    {
      "start": 168.3,
      "end": 173.18,
      "text": "This exact mechanical process, generating a response one token at a time, is called inference."
    },
    {
      "start": 174.62,
      "end": 176.88,
      "text": "Every answer is built one token at a time."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.26,
      "end": 178.42,
      "text": "The whole run is called inference."
    }
  ],
